extends Node
## AudioManager (autoload) — owner: audio. Every sound in Mèo Cam goes through here.
##
## * Sound bank: res://assets/audio/bank.json (generated by tools/audio/build.sh) maps a bank name to
##   1..n variant streams + bus, loop flag, 3D attenuation and voice priority. Variants are picked at random
##   without immediate repeats; unknown names are a silent no-op (warned once).
## * Pooled players: 3D (positional), 2D (non-positional world sounds), UI. Voice stealing by priority/age.
## * Buses (default_bus_layout.tres): Master, Music, SFX, Ambience, UI, Voice, and reverb-zone buses
##   Alley/Temple/Interior/Market for Area3D.reverb_bus_name. Volumes follow Settings audio/*.
## * Music director: crossfades, stingers with ducking, auto selection by phase/festival/dog chase, rests.
## * Ambience director: base bed by area + phase, overlays (dawn birds / night insects), weather layers
##   (rain, rain-on-tin when sheltered, storm wind), random thunder/gusts and positional spot sounds.
## * Reacts to GameEvents (meows, landings, jumps, items, quests, menus, dialogue ducking, weather...).
## See docs/areas/audio.md for every sound name and integration notes.

